---
import { MARK_PATH } from "../../lib/brand";
---

<section class="about shell" id="about">
  <div class="about-visual" data-reveal>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"
      ><rect x="4" y="4" width="504" height="504" rx="76" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"
      ></rect><path d={MARK_PATH} fill="currentColor"></path></svg
    >
  </div>
  <div class="about-body">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal><span>05</span>About</p>
    <h2 class="h-display" data-reveal>Hi, I&rsquo;m Maxi.</h2>
    <p class="about-lede" data-reveal>
      I like software that has an opinion and is a joy to use. Less is more, pragmatism beats
      ceremony, and you always know where a project stands.
    </p>
    <p data-reveal>
      I&rsquo;ve spent almost ten years as a senior engineer and tech lead, most of it freelance,
      across fintech, e-commerce, web3 and consumer apps. Today I build TaxMaxi and help other teams
      do the same kind of work. If something is a bad idea, I&rsquo;ll tell you before we build it.
    </p>
    <dl class="facts" data-reveal>
      <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Berlin, Germany</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Experience</dt><dd>~10 years, senior and lead roles</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Building</dt><dd><a href="https://taxmaxi.com">TaxMaxi</a></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Worked with</dt><dd>LIQID, Stryber, Showtime, YNAP</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
